  60:../src/FreeRTOS/port.c **** /* The stack used by interrupt service routines.  Set configISR_STACK_SIZE_WORDS
  61:../src/FreeRTOS/port.c ****  * to use a statically allocated array as the interrupt stack.  Alternative leave
  62:../src/FreeRTOS/port.c ****  * configISR_STACK_SIZE_WORDS undefined and update the linker script so that a
  63:../src/FreeRTOS/port.c ****  * linker variable names __freertos_irq_stack_top has the same value as the top
  64:../src/FreeRTOS/port.c ****  * of the stack used by main.  Using the linker script method will repurpose the
  65:../src/FreeRTOS/port.c ****  * stack that was used by main before the scheduler was started for use as the
  66:../src/FreeRTOS/port.c ****  * interrupt stack after the scheduler has started. */
